Confidential computing samples

These files are test data from Google's Go libraries for AMD SEV-SNP and
Intel TDX guests, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0):

  snp.bin    an SEV-SNP attestation report (version 2, debug policy)
             from https://github.com/google/go-sev-guest
  vcek.der   the VCEK certificate that signed snp.bin
             from https://github.com/google/go-sev-guest
  tdx.dat    a TDX quote (version 4) with its PCK certificate chain
             from https://github.com/google/go-tdx-guest

